### CREATE REPORT
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
content-type: application/json

{"price":25000,"make":"Porche","model":"911","year":2010,"lng":-122.4194,"lat":37.7749,"mileage":85000}

### APPROVE REPORT
PATCH http://localhost:3456/reports/17
content-type: application/json

{
    "approved": true
}

### GET ESTIMATE FOR AN EXISTING VEHICLE
GET http://localhost:3456/reports?make=Honda&model=Civic&lng=0&lat=0&mileage=20000&year=1980

### 1 MATCH: exact mileage
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":15000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2015,"lng":-122,"lat":37,"mileage":50000}

### 2 MATCH: mileage 5k off
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":14000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2014,"lng":-121.5,"lat":37.5,"mileage":55000}

### 3 MATCH: mileage 5k off
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":16500,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2016,"lng":-123,"lat":36,"mileage":45000}

### 4 MATCH: in range, mileage 100k off
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":5000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2017,"lng":-120,"lat":38,"mileage":150000}

### 5 MATCH: in range, mileage 45k off
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":30000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2013,"lng":-124,"lat":35,"mileage":5000}

### 6 EXCLUDED: year 5 too old
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":8000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2010,"lng":-122,"lat":37,"mileage":50000}

### 7 EXCLUDED: year 5 too new
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":25000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2020,"lng":-122,"lat":37,"mileage":50000}

### 8 EXCLUDED: longitude 12 away
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":40000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2015,"lng":-110,"lat":37,"mileage":50000}
### 9 EXCLUDED: latitude 8 away

POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":40000,"make":"Honda","model":"Civic","year":2015,"lng":-122,"lat":45,"mileage":50000}

### 10 EXCLUDED (for now): lowercase make and model
POST http://localhost:3456/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":50000,"make":"honda","model":"civic","year":2015,"lng":-122,"lat":37,"mileage":50000}

### ESTIMATE A: 2015 Civic, 50k miles
GET http://localhost:3456/reports?make=Honda&model=Civic&lng=-122&lat=37&year=2015&mileage=50000

### ESTIMATE B: same car, 150k miles
GET http://localhost:3456/reports?make=Honda&model=Civic&lng=-122&lat=37&year=2015&mileage=150000
